  "body": "The current spec has `bdo, bdo[dir] { unicode-bidi: isolate-override; }` in [14.3.5 Bidirectional text](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/rendering.html#bidi-rendering).\n\nI wonder why do we need both `bdo` and `bdo[dir]` in this rule? Couldn't it just be `bdo { unicode-bidi: isolate-override; }`?\n",
